OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening with clear spells.
OL,7,FRemaining dry and mostly cloudy
OL,8,Fovernight with some clearer intervals.
OL,9,FLight winds but becoming breezier
OL,10,Faround the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FIt will be a mostly dry and
OL,13,Fcloudy day but with some bright
OL,14,Fintervals breaking through. Outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain spreading east in the evening.
OL,16,FWindy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
