OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FStrong
OL,6,Fwinds and cloudy on Sunday with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain. Bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells and a few showers on Monday and
OL,9,FTuesday. Showers may be wintry over
